## Our principles

- **Open source:** transparent software supports verification, reuse, and
  reproducibility.
- **Reuse and integration:** build on strong community solutions and make them
  work together.
- **Quality assurance:** test scientific tools so reproducible results are also
  reliable results.
- **Community:** connect research groups, disciplines, software, and data.

